{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "符玄", "aliases": ["爻总"], "summary": {"text": "玉阙仙舟出身的卜者，拜太卜竟天为师，后因理念不合出走罗浮；方壶之战中提出动用瞰云镜向帝弓求救。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1208-3", "quote": "末学符玄，向太卜大人问安。", "offset_start": 90, "offset_end": 103}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1208-4", "quote": "符玄以近乎自我放逐的方式逃离了玉阙仙舟。她投身风气更自由的罗浮太卜司", "offset_start": 869, "offset_end": 903}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1208-5", "quote": "唯一的转机，是令帝弓垂迹示现。", "offset_start": 474, "offset_end": 489}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "卜官", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1208-5", "quote": "卜官符玄领命演算不休。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "竟天", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "玉阙仙舟太卜，符玄的业师，在塔拉萨求证预言时失去一只手并换成木制机巧，主张命运只有一条道路。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1208-2", "quote": "卜测结果已上呈太卜竟天大人", "offset_start": 556, "offset_end": 569}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1208-3", "quote": "男人苦笑着高举木手晃了晃。", "offset_start": 989, "offset_end": 1002}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1208-3", "quote": "从今天起，你应当称我为『师傅』。", "offset_start": 1045, "offset_end": 1061}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "玉阙仙舟太卜", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1208-2", "quote": "太卜竟天大人"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "景元", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "罗浮将军，在方壶之战中听取符玄建言，决定由六御动用瞰云镜，并愿承担全部后果。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1208-5", "quote": "在面见将军后，少女说出了她的想法。", "offset_start": 439, "offset_end": 456}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1208-5", "quote": "我作为进言呈辞者，会担负全部的后果", "offset_start": 794, "offset_end": 811}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "将军", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1208-5", "quote": "我要见景元将军！"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "波提欧", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "出身阿尔冈-阿帕歇的牛仔，家人被星际和平公司市场开拓部害死后接受改造，成为巡海游侠，持续袭击公司目标。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1315-4", "quote": "波提欧。在我的家乡，这个名字被用来称呼那些被人打死的枪手。", "offset_start": 676, "offset_end": 705}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1315-5", "quote": "波提欧。出生地未知。巡海游侠。", "offset_start": 377, "offset_end": 392}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1315-3", "quote": "这噩梦一般的名字和场景", "offset_start": 811, "offset_end": 822}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "巡海游侠", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1315-5", "quote": "巡海游侠。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "奥斯瓦尔多•施耐德", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "星际和平公司市场开拓部主管，下令以武力接管阿尔冈-阿帕歇，后其身影在历史记载中被抹去。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1315-5", "quote": "奥斯瓦尔多•施耐德，星际和平公司『市场开拓部』主管", "offset_start": 166, "offset_end": 191}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1315-5", "quote": "调查当时下令灭族的男人，却发现他的身影在历史记载中，早已被抹去。", "offset_start": 15, "offset_end": 47}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "市场开拓部主管", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1315-5", "quote": "市场开拓部主管"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "维里塔斯•拉帝奥", "aliases": ["真理医生", "拉帝奥"], "summary": {"text": "博学尖锐的学者，人称真理医生，加入博识学会，主张知识是一种特权，要以知识医治宇宙的愚蠢。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1305-5", "quote": "维里塔斯•拉帝奥", "offset_start": 88, "offset_end": 96}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1305-5", "quote": "无愧于「真理医生」之名。", "offset_start": 877, "offset_end": 889}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1305-5", "quote": "倘若愚钝是一种顽疾，学者的职责便是将其根除，医治宇宙。", "offset_start": 423, "offset_end": 450}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "称号", "value": "真理医生", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1305-5", "quote": "真理医生"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "黑塔", "aliases": ["大黑塔"], "summary": {"text": "天才俱乐部#83，模拟宇宙的创造者，隐居高塔，用人偶处理琐事并持续演算心中的疑问。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1401-2", "quote": "天才俱乐部#83黑塔女士的私人密藏品", "offset_start": 97, "offset_end": 115}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1401-5", "quote": "模拟宇宙一直在模拟星神并向祂们发问", "offset_start": 3, "offset_end": 20}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1401-4", "quote": "在那高塔顶端，她不再关心外界，只用演算心中尚存的疑问。", "offset_start": 409, "offset_end": 436}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "天才俱乐部#83", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1401-2", "quote": "天才俱乐部#83黑塔女士"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "AEON", "canonical_name": "阿哈", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "欢愉星神，在模拟宇宙中化作博识尊的模样戏弄黑塔，并邀请她加入假面愚者。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1506-5", "quote": "阿哈就是个欢愉的星神", "offset_start": 31, "offset_end": 41}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1401-5", "quote": "黑塔：阿哈，就知道是你！", "offset_start": 482, "offset_end": 494}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1401-5", "quote": "要不要来当假面愚者？", "offset_start": 691, "offset_end": 701}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "欢愉星神", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1506-5", "quote": "欢愉的星神"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
