{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "开拓者", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "星穹列车的无名客，与伙伴在多个世界开拓，在翁法罗斯以身入局，直面毁灭的命运。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1510-4", "quote": "她与开拓者在空间站相遇", "offset_start": 623, "offset_end": 634}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1415-4", "quote": "开拓者，不要悲伤，好吗？"}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1414-4", "quote": "开拓者以身入局，归还「岁月」的火种。"}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "无名客", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1510-4", "quote": "无名客从来不是一个人的名字"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
